    op(input, num_spatial_dims, padding)

  Otherwise, it returns:

    batch_to_space_nd(
      op(space_to_batch_nd(input, adjusted_dilation_rate, adjusted_paddings),
         num_spatial_dims,
         "VALID")
      adjusted_dilation_rate,
      adjusted_crops),

